===Noun===
{{be-noun|яйцо́<*#(-)>|adj=яе́чны|dim=яе́чка}}

# [[egg]] {{gl|approximately spherical or ellipsoidal body produced by birds, insects, reptiles, and other animals, housing the embryo within a membrane or shell during its development}}
#: {{syn|be|я́йка}}
