|page=23|pageurl=https://be.wikisource.org/wiki/Старонка:Prypieŭki_(1918).pdf/25
|text=Kurka mnie '''jajco''' źniasie, / Tabie padaruju.
|t=A hen will lay an '''egg''' for me, and I'll gift it to you.}}
# {{lb|be|colloquial|usually|in the plural}} [[testicle]], [[ball]] {{gl|the male sex and endocrine gland, found in most types of animals, that produces sperm}}
#: {{syn|be|яе́чка}}
#* {{quote-book|be|year=2003|author=w:be:Уладзімір Някляеў|chapter=Гульні жаданняў|title=Лабух|location=w:Minsk
|year2=2022|chapter2=Піянерскі салют|title2=Дванаццаць актаў (зборнік)|publisher2=Litres|isbn2=9785041404536
|url2=https://books.google.com/books?id=Swp2DwAAQBAJ&pg=PT19
|text=Па беразе кульгаў прыгорблены Максім Герасімавіч Блонак [...] '''Яйцы''' ён гразіў адарваць і піянерам, і піянеркам — хто іх там у вадзе разбярэ.
|t=Along the shore hobbled the hunched Maksim Hierasimavič Błonak [...] He was making threats to tear off the '''testicles''' of both the pioneer boys and girls alike—not that anyone could tell them apart in the water anyway.}}
# [[ovum]] {{gl|the female gamete in animals; the egg cell}}
#: {{syn|be|аацы́т|яйцакле́тка}}

